@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Existing contract: commonElements must be [6, 19]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/arrays/common-elements
Content-Type: application/json

{"left":[4,5,6,12,2,6,19,1],"right":[7,19,3,6]}

### Empty arrays are valid
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/arrays/common-elements
Content-Type: application/json

{"left":[],"right":[6]}

### Null elements are invalid: HTTP 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/arrays/common-elements
Content-Type: application/json

{"left":[6,null],"right":[6]}